  "summary": "Standard glycaemic control intervention for people with diabetes to prevent microvascular complications.\nThis intervention works by maintaining optimal blood glucose levels through medication management and glucose monitoring.\nThe intervention reduces progression from diabetes to diabetic nephropathy, retinopathy, and other complications by providing systematic glucose control with standard home glucose monitoring for insulin-treated patients.\n",
  "title": "Clinical Intervention - Standard Glycaemic Control"
